    "description": "Primary, secondary and tertiary colour on the wheel, the three properties of hue, value and chroma, warm and cool colour, tint, shade and tone, neutralising with complements, mixing clean greens and rich browns, simultaneous contrast, and the reading of colour in Ghanaian signage.",
    "isFreeTrial": false,
