          "Step 5 (M1): Let colour one dry to touch, then re-align sheet two to the crosses and apply the dark accent colour.",
          "Step 6 (A1): Lift each sheet straight up while its paint is still firm-dry; the finished words show hard edges, full registration and no bleed, which is the mark of a sign-studio stencil."
